  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=57710\" target=\"_blank\">La XXXI Setmana del Centre Cultural Suera ha acabat com va comen&ccedil;ar, traslladant per la pluja a l&#39;auditori de la Uni&oacute; Musical</a>, ple de gom a gom, un acte previst a l&#39;aire lliure, aquesta vegada el concert de la pr&ograve;pia banda.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_4866.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Sota la direcci&oacute; del titular, Jos&eacute; Dami&aacute;n Navarro Centelles, la banda de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera ha interpretat Ole Toronto (Ferrer Ferran), Selecci&oacute; de Mary Poppins (Richard M. i Robert B.Sherman), Selecci&oacute; del Fantasma de l&#39;&Ograve;pera (Andrew Lloyd Weber), Virgina (Jacob de Haan) i la Part I de Danses Arm&egrave;nies (Alfred Reed).</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertuniomusicalsetmanaculturalsuera15/img_4836.jpg\" alt=\"img_4836\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertuniomusicalsetmanaculturalsuera15/img_4838.jpg\" alt=\"img_4838\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertuniomusicalsetmanaculturalsuera15/img_4839.jpg\" alt=\"img_4839\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertuniomusicalsetmanaculturalsuera15/img_4840.jpg\" alt=\"img_4840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertuniomusicalsetmanaculturalsuera15/img_4841.jpg\" alt=\"img_4841\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a9